dayOfWeek — Name the weekday a date lands on — a Monday, a Saturday.
  needs: date: string
  e.g. "what day of the week is 14 November 2026" → {"date":"2026-11-14"}

isWeekend — Say whether a date is a weekend or a working day.
  needs: date: string
  e.g. "is 2026-11-14 a weekend" → {"date":"2026-11-14"}

daysInMonth — Say how many days long a given month is.
  needs: month: integer, year: integer
  e.g. "how many days in february 2026" → {"month":2,"year":2026}

shuffleList — Jumble any list into a random order from a seed.
  needs: items: array, seed: integer
  e.g. "shuffle these with seed 7" → {"items":[1,2,3,4,5],"seed":7}

diffJson — Compare two JSON documents and list the paths added, removed and changed.
  needs: left: string, right: string
  e.g. "diff these two json documents" → {"left":"{\"name\":\"Ana\",\"age\":34}","right":"{\"name\":\"Bea\",\"age\":34,\"city\":\"Leeds\"}"}

extractCurrencyAmounts — Pull every money amount out of a text, with its currency.
